+      failure is gone"). It also counts a project's `<plugin>@skill-manager` enablement of
+      its OWN path under the old name as shape 4, and its clause_1 text still says
+      "pending OHV-6". The home repair detector (OHV-6) reads the checkout files; the
+      harness should read the same ones.
