+      python3 scripts/measure_goal_one_marketplace_identity.py --fleet   # fleet shape1: 0
+    disk_observation: >
+      tla-spec-dev and meta-orchestrator checkout .claude/plugins/known_marketplaces.json
+      registered their own plugin-marketplace as `skill-manager` (backups under
+      wt-epic-one-home-one-verdict/results/epic-one-home-one-verdict/tickets/OHV-6-backups/);
+      measure_before.json reports shape1 0 for both.
+    evidence:
+      - results/epic-one-home-one-verdict/tickets/OHV-6/baseline/measure_before.json
+      - results/epic-one-home-one-verdict/tickets/OHV-6/baseline/ohv6-build-prefix/tla-spec-dev.repair.json
+    suggested_fix: >
+      read <checkout>/.claude/plugins/known_marketplaces.json (root: ~/.claude/...) per home,
+      as MarketplaceRegistrations does; or call `home repair --json` and count the four
+      MARKETPLACE_* kinds. OHV-8 should read clause (3) with this in mind.
+    disposition: pending
